    <name>TSP CHX composite route - Chamonix to Marseille</name>
    <desc>Vehicle-followable Route Napoleon corridor reconstructed from 2024/2025 team accounts (Cavale 438km, RAD 436km/37h, AAAC-Ravanel 450km/12000m D+, RC Catalans 460km). Waypoint-level: import into Komoot/RideWithGPS/Strava route builder to snap to roads. Polyline here cuts corners; road-snapped total lands ~415-430km.</desc>
    <time>2026-07-02T21:03:03Z</time>
  </metadata>
